//
// > "i want the conversion or projection, whatever you call it, can you do a qqq -> NQ -> ES ?"
//
// ⚠⚠ FIRST, WHAT THIS IS NOT. SPY -> ES is a CONVERSION: they track the same index, so 765 SPY IS
