  // (v15.54) the feature scorecards moved to Testing ⊕ — they are a trust question, not an analysis one.
  // ---- (v15.54) THE TAB IN WORKFLOW ORDER — design/ARCHITECTURE-E2E-WORKFLOW.md §3 ----
